{
  "version": "0.6.6",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-23T05:01:15+03:00",
  "notes": [
    "Adds Bazaar-style hover explanations to every Minion Calculator table column.",
    "Fixes the first-load Tier mismatch that could show Tier 11 in the control while calculating Tier 1 rows.",
    "Compares LIVE and historical prices using the exact same winning minion setup instead of optimizing two different setups.",
    "Prevents Soulflow Engine and Lesser Soulflow Engine from being equipped together.",
    "Splits true gross revenue, Bazaar tax, recurring cost and net profit into separate values.",
    "Automatically refreshes History products and Reliable history when the background history calculation finishes.",
    "Limits the LIVE comparison selector to the number of reliable history days currently available.",
    "Adds stale-request guards so older calculations cannot overwrite newer settings.",
    "Improves Windows update restart reliability by launching server.mjs directly, with batch fallback and detailed restart logging."
  ],
